593
00:47:44.534 --> 00:47:45.978
Nee.

594
00:47:46.078 --> 00:47:50.292
Er is soda.
donuts. of zoiets.

595
00:47:50.375 --> 00:47:53.003
Ik heb 'n paar gebakjes.

596
